      "content": "extends Node\nclass_name Player\n\nsignal damaged(amount: int)\nconst MAX_HEALTH := 100\nvar health: int = MAX_HEALTH\n\nfunc take_damage(amount: int) -> int:\n\tvar café := \"🔥\"\n\thealth -= amount\n\tdamaged.emit(amount)\n\treturn health\n",
